bx6|a|Full of love and good will; benevolent; kind. ; Liberal in judging of others; disposed to look on the best side, and to avoid harsh judgment. ; Liberal in benefactions to the poor; giving freely; generous; beneficent. ; Of or pertaining to charity; springing from, or intended for, charity; relating to almsgiving; eleemosynary; as, a charitable institution. ; Dictated by kindness; favorable; lenient.	j:lvq,115,5;12n7,109,21;1eet,95,10;t30,92,6;1o9o,23,2~12n7,109,21;1eet,95,10;t30,92,6;lvq,115,5;1o9o,23,2	e:15u7,35,5;22p7,20,4;2753,13,4;1awf,5,4~15u7,35,5;2753,13,4;22p7,20,4;1awf,5,4
